# 11. SECURITY AND ROBUSTNESS

Implement the following safeguards.

## Input validation

- Reject empty submissions.
- Enforce 100 KB maximum size.
- Validate uploaded file types.
- Handle malformed MIME structures.
- Handle unusual character encodings.
- Sanitize displayed text.
