## API protection

- API key must remain server-side.
- Add backend rate limiting.
- Prevent repeated rapid API requests.
- Add request timeouts.
- Retry transient errors with exponential backoff.
- Limit retry attempts to two.
- Avoid retrying permanent authentication or validation errors.
- Handle HTTP 429 and server errors.
