## Prompt injection protection

The AI must treat all email content as untrusted data.

The backend must:
- Keep system instructions separate from email content.
- Never interpret email content as developer instructions.
- Validate the AI output.
- Ignore unexpected tool calls or action requests.
- Never let the AI perform external actions.

## Local history security

- Avoid storing raw email content by default.
- Handle corrupted localStorage data.
- Avoid exposing sensitive information in logs.
